  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, salt, black pepper, garlic powder, and Mediterranean seasoning blend.",
    "Add the halved Brussels sprouts to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated Brussels sprouts onto the wooden skewers, leaving a small space between each sprout.",
    "Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Brush the tops of the Brussels sprouts with additional olive oil and roast in the preheated oven for 20-25 minutes, or until tender and caramelized.",
    "Remove the skewers from the oven and garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
